"The typical calculation is one CPU core for every 2 gigabytes (GiB) of total "
"memory. At least 1 core will be specified, and no more than <option><link "
"linkend=\"conf-num-cores\">num-cores</link></option> cores will be specified."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: conf-options-table.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
