"<filename>~/.local/state/kdesrc-build-data</filename> (<filename>"
"$XDG_STATE_HOME/kdesrc-build-data</filename>, if <envar>$XDG_STATE_HOME</"
"envar> is set). If you have multiple available configurations in the same "
"directory, you may want to manually set this option, so that different "
"configurations do not end up with conflicting persistent data."
