#: conf-options-table.docbook:527
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a valid toolchain file is configured, &kdesrc-build; will <emphasis>no "
"longer set environment variables automatically</emphasis>. You can use &set-"
"env;, &binpath; and &libpath; to fix up the environment manually if your "
